@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "victor",
  "email": "victor@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Login (token yahan se save hota hai)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "victor@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Token variable (login ke baad apne aap bharta hai)
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Notes WITHOUT token -> 403 "No token provided"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes

### 4. Create note (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "My First Note",
  "content": "This is my first note of web dev -III"
}

### 5. Get all notes (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get one note (id apni note se replace karo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/PASTE_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Update note
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/PASTE_NOTE_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated title"
}

### 8. Delete note
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/PASTE_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Current user (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Admin only route (normal user ko 403 milega)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
